{"id":"5760671df4bcea40bb76b1e0850d4fe4","message":"for stable-diffusion-xl-1024-v0-9 and stable-diffusion-xl-1024-v1-0 the allowed dimensions are 1024x1024, 1152x896, 1216x832, 1344x768, 1536x640, 640x1536, 768x1344, 832x1216, 896x1152, but we received 512x512","name":"invalid_sdxl_v1_dimensions"}
